#: includes/class-render.php:3961
msgid ""
"How each pair of signs stands in the zodiac: the classical relation, "
"harmonious, challenging or unrelated. It is a relation of signs, not a "
"score; for two people, their charts say far more."
msgstr ""
"Hogyan áll egymáshoz a zodiákusban minden jegypár: a klasszikus viszony, "
