#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:147
msgid ""
"Past, present and future, or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this "
"site, each card read in its position. Rendered into the page; no key needed."
msgstr ""
"Múlt, jelen és jövő, vagy a Kelta kereszt, naponta egyszer húzva ennek az "
"oldalnak; minden kártya a saját helyén értelmezve. Az oldalba renderelve; "
"nem kell kulcs."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:151
msgid ""
"three-card (default) for past, present and future, or celtic-cross for the "
"Celtic Cross."
msgstr ""
"three-card (alapértelmezett) a múlthoz, jelenhez és jövőhöz, vagy celtic-"
"cross a Kelta kereszthez."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:152
msgid ""
"yes (default) shows a Draw again button that deals the visitor a new spread,"
" not kept or cached; no hides it."
msgstr ""
"yes (alapértelmezett) megjelenít egy \"Újrahúzás\" gombot, amely új kirakást"
" ad a látogatónak, se nem mentve, se nem gyorsítótárazva; no elrejti."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:157
msgid "Mini Birth Chart"
msgstr "Mini Születési Horoszkóp"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:158
msgid "The natal wheel drawn small, for a sidebar. Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"A születési horoszkóp kicsiben ábrázolva, oldalsávhoz. Keretben jelenik meg."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:167
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:179
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:190
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:205
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:216
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:230
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:243
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:276
msgid "light (default), dark or console."
msgstr "világos (alapértelmezett), sötét vagy konzol."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:172
